  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ORGANIZATION AL CAPACITY OF PROMOTERS, PROMOTING HEALTH AND MIDWIVES FOR THE IMPACT ON PUBLIC HEALTH POLICY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin de Promotores de Salud y Comadronas de Petn (APROSACOP) will implement a twelve-month planning grant to strengthen and consolidate its technical and organizational capacity and identify challenges currently confronting member health promoters and midwives. Project activities will include the creation of a strategic plan, updating and analyzing a previously conducted assessment on the socioeconomic situation of the volunteer health promoters, and administrative and leadership training for the organization&apos;s leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
